<section class="veylune-trust-services" aria-labelledby="veylune-trust-services-title" data-veylune-reveal>
    <div class="veylune-trust-services__intro">
        <p class="veylune-trust-services__eyebrow">Planning support</p>
        <h2 id="veylune-trust-services-title">Clarity before public commerce opens.</h2>
        <p>Studio guidance is available now. Order, payment, delivery, and return terms remain subject to launch verification.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="veylune-trust-services__grid">
        <article class="veylune-trust-service">
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Access planning</h3>
                <p>Review room access, dimensions, placement, and handling questions before a future order.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__meta">Plan ahead</span>
        </article>

        <article class="veylune-trust-service">
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Material guidance</h3>
                <p>Discuss finish, texture, proportion, and the spatial context around a considered piece.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__meta">Here to help</span>
        </article>

        <article class="veylune-trust-service">
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Commerce readiness</h3>
                <p>Payment, delivery, and return terms will be published before checkout is activated.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__meta">Verification pending</span>
        </article>

        <a class="veylune-trust-service veylune-trust-service--consultation"
           href="{{ veyluneRoutes.consultation }}"
           data-veylune-page-transition>
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__index" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Design consultation</h3>
                <p>Personal guidance for materials, proportion, and spatial direction.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="veylune-trust-service__meta">Begin a dialogue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
